lee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.9 kg (1.8 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.9 kg (1.8 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_GLO_Moonlantern</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_GLO_Moonlantern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_GLO_Moonlantern\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9aca1109-a59d-47d3-8f35-f248b70518f9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9aca1109-a59d-47d3-8f35-f248b70518f9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:9aca1109-a59d-47d3-8f35-f248b70518f9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> </div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Moonshield\"> Condition: Moonshield </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\">Moonshield</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;13 m (43 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;13 m (43 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Protected by the light of a <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Moonlantern</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a>. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a> does not affect this entity.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;0&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-15</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/38px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/50px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kar'niss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>, either after the Harper ambush or at the top of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-63&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;172</span>: Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Isobel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\">Isobel</a> if letting the Harpers take the Moonlantern</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>: In <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/38px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/50px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png/25px-Portrait_Balthazar.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Balthazar.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar's</a> room in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Moonlantern carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/38px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/50px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kar'niss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a> contains a foul-mouthed pixie <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dolly_Dolly_Dolly\" title=\"Dolly Dolly Dolly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png/25px-Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png/38px-Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png/50px-Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dolly Dolly Dolly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png/25px-Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Dolly_Dolly_Dolly.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dolly_Dolly_Dolly\" title=\"Dolly Dolly Dolly\">Dolly Dolly Dolly</a> who wants out. If freed using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Inspect_Moonlantern\" title=\"Inspect Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp/25px-Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp/38px-Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp/50px-Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Inspect Moonlantern\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp/25px-Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Inspect_Moonlantern_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Inspect_Moonlantern\" title=\"Inspect Moonlantern\">Inspect Moonlantern</a>, she grants the party a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a>.</li>\n<li>If Dolly is freed, her Moonlantern remains in the inventory of the character who freed her, but its inventory icon changes to a broken version and the lantern cannot be equipped anymore.</li>\n<li>If Kar'niss arrives at Moonrise Towers with the lantern (whether he escorted the party or not), Dolly dies inside it.</li>\n<li>If Kar'niss is killed at the ambush and the lantern is taken by the Harpers, the party can follow them back to <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>. There <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Isobel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\">Isobel</a> gives the party the same Moonlantern with Dolly Dolly Dolly alive inside; she can be freed and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a> may then still be obtained.</li>\n<li>Switching to ranged weapons while having a Moonlantern equipped retains the Moonshield effect but removes the illumination, allowing darkness-requiring effects such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Critical_(Condition)\" title=\"Covert Critical (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Covert Critical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Critical_(Condition)\" title=\"Covert Critical (Condition)\">Covert Critical</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Step\" title=\"Shadow Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Shadow_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Step\" title=\"Shadow Step\">Shadow Step</a> to be safely used within the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a>.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Moonlantern\" title=\"Broken Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Broken_Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Moonlantern\" title=\"Broken Moonlantern\">Broken Moonlantern</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Pixie\" title=\"Dead Pixie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Dead_Pixie_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Pixie\" title=\"Dead Pixie\">Dead Pixie</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Filigreed_Feywild_Bell\" title=\"Filigreed Feywild Bell\">Filigreed Feywild Bell</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Moonlantern containing Dolly Dolly Dolly still produces a stationary Moonshield Aura when dropped on the ground even after she has been freed from it.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 373.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 371.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jpg/557px-Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jpg/836px-Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Jane-katsubo-lantern1.jp